    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to &quot;Strange day&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a strange day when no one is around, Nick heads to 4th Street. There, he becomes entangled in a mysterious incident and is transported back to the past of a murder scene that occurred days ago. Nick must solve the puzzles left behind by the perpetrator to unravel the case. Will Nick be able to solve this mystery?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game includes elements of math and puzzles. You need to solve this problems and mistery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Exploration and Narrative Elements</strong>: Players will explore various city regions, uncover\u00a0 \u00a0hidden clues, and solve puzzles to progress through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Tension</strong>: The unique in-game environment, shifting between reality and hallucinations, creates a sense of suspense and tension for the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Graphics and Audio</strong>: The dark, surreal city environment combines with distinctive visual elements, offering a unique experience. Additionally, the  audio design enhances the game's atmosphere, further immersing players in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to &quot;Strange day&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a strange day when no one is around, Nick heads to 4th Street. There, he becomes entangled in a mysterious incident and is transported back to the past of a murder scene that occurred days ago. Nick must solve the puzzles left behind by the perpetrator to unravel the case. Will Nick be able to solve this mystery?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game includes elements of math and puzzles. You need to solve this problems and mistery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Exploration and Narrative Elements</strong>: Players will explore various city regions, uncover\u00a0 \u00a0hidden clues, and solve puzzles to progress through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Tension</strong>: The unique in-game environment, shifting between reality and hallucinations, creates a sense of suspense and tension for the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Graphics and Audio</strong>: The dark, surreal city environment combines with distinctive visual elements, offering a unique experience. Additionally, the  audio design enhances the game's atmosphere, further immersing players in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
